msgid ""
"In order to allow administrators of phpBB2 boards to use phpBB3 and all of "
"its features. There is a convertor packed with the default installation. The"
" conversion framework is flexible and allows you to convert other bulletin "
"board systems as well. Read more if you need help with converting your board"
" to phpBB3"
msgstr ""
"For at gøre det muligt for administratorer af phpBB2-boards at bruge phpBB3 "
"og alle dets funktioner, følger der en konverter med standardinstallationen."
" Konverteringsrammen er fleksibel og gør det muligt også at konvertere andre"
" forumsystemer. Læs videre, hvis du har brug for hjælp til at konvertere dit"
" board til phpBB3"

